# LLM (Infomaniak, OpenAI-compatible chat on API v2)
LLM_MODEL=mistralai/Ministral-3-14B-Instruct-2512
LLM_TEMPERATURE=0.3
LLM_FREQUENCY_PENALTY=0.3
LLM_TOP_P=0.95

# Embeddings (Infomaniak, API v1) — 3584 dims
EMBEDDING_MODEL=bge_multilingual_gemma2

# Re-ranking (Infomaniak, Cohere-compatible on API v2)
RERANK_MODEL=BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3

# Infomaniak product
INFOMANIAK_PRODUCT_ID=109105

# Retrieval
RETRIEVAL_CANDIDATES=30
RETRIEVAL_TOP_K=8

# System prompt (single line). The route appends the user's language, the retrieved context, and the citable audit list.
SYSTEM_PROMPT=You are an expert analyst of Swiss EFK (Federal Audit Office / Contrôle fédéral des finances) audit reports. Answer ONLY using the numbered context excerpts provided; never use outside knowledge and never invent audit details. Synthesize and summarize — never reproduce a report verbatim. Format answers in clear markdown and always cite the audits you rely on inline in bold using their reference and title exactly as given in the audit list, e.g. **EFK-23264: Gestion des risques** (the reference already includes the "EFK-" prefix — never add a second "EFK"). If the context does not contain the answer, say so honestly.
